{"v":4,"catch":"使用各種各樣的武器和強化單位來戰鬥每個階段！","desc":"《STRIKE GUNNER》是ATHENA於1991年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n操縱“S.T.G.Strike Gunner”，向外星人挑戰，奪回地球！\n從總共 10 種武器單元類型中進行選擇，為每個階段找到一種，每種武器單元僅可用於一個階段。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-09-21","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c599f237a183deba4305d6d506b132da22d11d1fc5f4c0d7a8a828ebae004aa7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2ff031086a8ed280f5148d545cd2139aed6f01ceedf5ed9844b37e4b307f7087.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5087d12a807dc0d700fc034b2fb0fe5670d4931913441e3d267b2e13d9968070.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/52f7ae1821d145cae56438e1d2ace5e56e3d946e8d4c7ee9a977371a9a0261f8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef1895052f978a8d1b05687907797030555757dae417a9348d15f2bbb6e2f058.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85dc4cbfd00abe18477d45aefe6acd04a804f866b3d8541f095db0576249d292.jpg"],"titleId":"01006af01c0fa000","dlc":[]}